# SCPN MIF MagLIF Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN MIF MagLIF Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the magnetised liner inertial
  fusion (MagLIF) configuration within the SCPN Reactor Systems Research
  Group. Evidence maturity computational_prototype: a validated device
  configuration model, diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with the
  SCPN Phase Orchestrator observability catalogue, level-0 device physics
  (the three-stage drive in closed form: azimuthal drive field and
  pressure of the load current, liner mass and kinetic energy, preheat
  energy per fuel volume; and ideal axial-flux and adiabatic compression
  recorded as upper bounds), and tessellated and B-rep models of the fuel
  column, liner, laser-entrance foil and coil pair. Parameter sets are
  synthetic or anchored on a filed related public source; no real machine
  is described, and the claim inventory is empty.
authors:
